    "abstract": "Parts list for the cargo door latching mechanism, listing the latch stiffener, the bearing retaining rib, the latch support ribs, the upper latch brackets and the fastener set that holds them.",
    "sections": {
      "purpose": "This figure identifies the detail parts of the cargo door latching mechanism, including the latch shaft bearing installation and the warning sensor target plate.",
      "figure_note": "Item 20 is the bearing retaining rib used with the greased bronze bushes. The grease nipple at each bearing position is a vendor detail of item 20 and is not separately listed; the lubrication interval is in the applicable maintenance task and not in this figure. Bushes are supplied as a matched set of four and single-bush replacement is not permitted. The figure covers one door; both cargo doors use the same parts list."
    },
